AWS SigV4 signing test suite (vendored subset)

Source: the aws-c-auth test suite, tests/aws-signing-test-suite/v4, version
v0.9.0 (https://github.com/awslabs/aws-c-auth), as redistributed in the
aws-sigv4 crate 1.6.0 (https://crates.io/crates/aws-sigv4).

