The files are unmodified. Only the vectors whose rules S3 shares are
included (31 of 40): the path-normalization ("-normalized" with dot
segments or repeated slashes) and double-encoding vectors apply to other
AWS services, and get-header-value-multiline uses header folding, which
HTTP/1.1 forbids. Of each vector, context.json and the header- and
query-signed requests with their canonical requests and strings to sign
are kept. src/sigv4/vectors.rs runs them.
